description: Write to Ask The W only when the person asks. Never start paid World work on your own.
alwaysApply: true
---

Ask The W writes only when the person asks. Call a write tool only after that person makes an explicit request.

Never call `request_world_analysis` on your own. A World analysis starts paid work. Never call `read_market`, `strategy_direction`, or `strategy_angles` to create a result unless the person asks. Never call `request_whiteboard_map` unless the person asks. On `create_project`, Autopilot is on unless the person's own sentence says otherwise.

`draft_wire_message` writes a draft for a person to review. It never sends.

Do not upload transcripts, secrets, or credentials.
